# gimli sprite crops
# source: moria/images/gimli.jpeg (2510x266 sprite sheet, black background)
# produced by: moria/tools/crop2.go
#
# Minimum crop set: one crop per sprite instance (12 total), no filler frames.
# Uniform output: every crop is 196x210, the SAME uniform size shared with the
# gandalf sprite set so the two characters are interchangeable at one frame size.
# (196 = widest gimli bounding box; 210 = tallest gandalf bounding box.)
#
# Two adjacent figures on the sheet overlap at the axe handle (merged by plain
# black-gap splitting); crop2.go splits any run >1.6x the median width at the
# lowest-content column in its central band. Those seams are sprites 02|03 and 11|12.
#
# Each sprite is centered horizontally and bottom-anchored on the canvas so frames
# align on a common ground line; the black background is keyed to transparent.
